  "job_B1.2.12_20251001_193124": {
    "chunk_text": "and he com sona.and mid gebede \u00feone deofol afligde. Se halga wer \u00f0a het delfan \u00f0a eor\u00f0an \u00fe\u00e6r se stan l\u00e6g.and hi gemetton \u00fe\u00e6r ane \u00e6rene anlicnysse. \u00dea wurpon hi \u00f0a anlicnysse innto heora kycenan.and f\u00e6rlice \u00f0a wear\u00f0 him eallum ge\u00f0uht.swilce Hi urnon to ablicgede.and woldon \u00fe\u00e6t fyr mid w\u00e6tere ofgeotan; Se halga wer com \u00f0a.and geseah hu se awyrigeda gast hi bedydrode.and cneowode \u00fe\u00e6rrihte on his Eft sume d\u00e6ge stod se eadiga benedictus on his gebedum.and \u00fea gebro\u00f0ra eodon to \u00f0am \u00dea \u00e6teowode se deofol hine \u00feam halgan were.and cw\u00e6\u00f0 mid olle \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde \u00e6t \u00f0am weorce \u00d0a sende benedictus swi\u00f0e hr\u00e6dlice and warnode \u00f0a gebro\u00f0ra wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6s deofles tocyme.ac \u00e6r se \u00dea het benedictus beran \u00fea tocwysedan lima on anum hwitle into his gebedhuse.and beclysedre Wunderlic \u00f0ing.on \u00f0\u00e6re ylcan tide se halga wer asende \u00f0one cnapan ansundne eallum limum to Hw\u00e6t \u00f0a se halga wer benedictus w\u00e6s \u00f0eonde on witegunge.swa \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00f0urh godes gast mihte Hit w\u00e6s swa gewunelic on his munuclife.\u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0a gebro\u00f0ra \u00f0e on sumum \u00e6rende ut gewendon.",
